      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在项目里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It ends its current turn on the Mac. Its worktree and conversation stay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它会在 Mac 上结束当前这一轮，worktree 和对话都会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It was removed on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它已在 Mac 上被移除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Making progress": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有进展"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message the Router…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "给 Router 发消息…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Message this worker…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发消息给这个 Worker…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Messages go to the Router on your Mac; workers run there with its agents, and the results show up here. This phone keeps no threads of its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息发到 Mac 上的 Router，Worker 在那台 Mac 上用它的 Agent 运行，结果显示在这里。手机不保存对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "更多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
