      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有改动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No project": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不指定项目"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No threads yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有对话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing answered at that address. Check the address, that access is on in Owlto's Settings → Devices on the Mac, and that Owlto may use the local network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个地址没有回应。请检查地址，确认 Mac 上 Owlto 的 设置 → 设备 里打开了访问，并允许 Owlto 使用本地网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing needs you": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有等你处理的事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offline · last connected %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线 · 上次连接 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the Mac, open Owlto → Settings → Devices and turn on “Let paired devices use this Mac”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Mac 上打开 Owlto → 设置 → 设备，打开「允许已配对的设备使用这台 Mac」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the same Wi-Fi the Mac's local address works as is; away from home, use its Tailscale address. The connection is encrypted end to end and goes through no server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一个 Wi-Fi 下直接用 Mac 的局域网地址；在外面请用它的 Tailscale 地址。连接端到端加密，不经过任何服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线 · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the start of this file is shown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只显示了这个文件的开头。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open it on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 Mac 上打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the thread ›": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开对话 ›"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Or type another answer…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "或输入其他回答…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outside your projects": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不在你的项目里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owlto only reads files in your projects, workspace, and worker folders.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Owlto 只读取你的项目、Workspace 和 Worker 文件夹里的文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Owlto restarted on the Mac before the Router confirmed it got these events. Resending may show the Router a message twice; dropping means it never learns about them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 上的 Owlto 在 Router 确认收到这些事件之前重启了。重发可能让 Router 看到重复的消息；丢掉则 Router 不会知道这些事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pair": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对"
