    "Style": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "风格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That Mac did not answer in time. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 没有及时回应，请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That Mac is not connected. Check that it is on, awake, and running Owlto.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 没有连接，请确认它已开机、没有睡眠，并且 Owlto 正在运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That Mac no longer recognizes this phone, or its identity changed. Remove it and pair again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 已不认识这部手机，或者它的身份变了。请移除后重新配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That Mac runs a different version of Owlto. Update both apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 运行的 Owlto 版本不同，请把两边都更新到最新版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac sent something this app could not read.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac 发来了这个 App 读不懂的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Router splits the work and sends workers to your projects. Their results come back here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Router 会拆分工作，把 Worker 派到你的项目里，结果会回到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The code did not work. Check it, or show a new code on the Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配对码不对。请检查，或在 Mac 上重新显示配对码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The worker is busy; new messages queue…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Worker 正在工作，新消息会先排队…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file cannot be previewed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件无法预览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This image cannot be shown": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这张图片无法显示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This only works on the Mac itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个操作只能在 Mac 上进行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这部手机"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone forgets the Mac and must pair again to use it. Nothing on the Mac is deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "手机会忘记这台 Mac，之后要重新配对才能使用。Mac 上的内容不会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This worker is gone": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
